  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term of a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;with first term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and common ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>b</mi></math> and <math><mn>15</mn><mi>c</mi></math> are in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The&nbsp;only acceptable value is <math><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> because&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;the first term of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;the common difference&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></math></p><p>Also, we know that the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term of an&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;with first term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and common difference&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
